 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "The Mordell Conjecture in Lean",
  "excerpt": "A Lean 4 (v4.35.0) formalization of Faltings' theorem, the Mordell conjecture, following the proof of E. Bombieri, *The Mordell conjecture revisited* (Ann. Scuola Norm. Sup. Pisa Cl. Sci. (4) 17 (1990), 615–640), of P. Vojta's theorem (*Siegel's theorem in the compact case*, Ann. of Math. 133 (1991), 509–548), built on [Mathlib](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4) and on [the Stacks Project in Lean](https://github.com/AxiomMath/Stacks). Lean's kernel checks every proof. There is no `sorry`, no `native_decide` and no added axiom."
 },
